# scratch / research artefacts that live outside the deliverable
_imd_research/
node_modules/
*.log

# data/history.json IS tracked on purpose: it is the raw event index the CI refresh job
# starts from. Without it, the first run on a runner would rescan 160k blocks (30+ min);
# with it, every run is incremental. The workflow never commits changes to it — the file
# is carried between runs by actions/cache instead, so the repository does not grow by
# 7 MB every hour.

# acceptance screenshots (regenerate with scripts/shoot.mjs)
shots/

